  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I feel like a much clearer way of explaining differences between friends and friends+ (as well as the invite/invite+) would to instead include a separate checkbox called \"Guests can invite\" in the new instance pop-up. Turning this checkbox on converts a friends or invite instance into a friends+ or invite+ instance while cleaning up the UI a bit and making it somewhat clearer to the user.\n\nAnother additional feature is to allow the host/master of the instance, who already has warn and kick abilities, to be able to toggle the \"Guest can invite\" feature after the instance is already set up. This allows rooms that are starting to get crowded to have this toggled on without everyone having to switch instances.",
